# Marble

## Arrays

### Primitive operations

There are four primitive operations on arrays:

* `make n x` creates a new array of length `n`, filled with the value `x`.
   Its [specification](array.v:Lemma wp_make)
   has the precondition that `n` should not exceed `max_array_length`.
   The tactic [`wp_make`](array.v:Ltac wp_make) helps reason about it.

* `length`

* `get`

* `set`
